Enter an amount within your available USD balance. Active investment principal and target estimates are not available funds.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Confirm your destination.
Select the supported asset and network. Enter your external wallet address and check every detail.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
Review, then request.
If two-factor protection is enabled, enter your current six-digit code. Confirm the destination details and choose Request withdrawal.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000 line:84% position:50% size:90% align:center
